flowchart LR
  A[01 Join and establish trust] --> B[02 Connect permitted sources]
  B --> C[03 Understand the business]
  C --> D[04 Define success and rules]
  D --> E[05 Receive and remember events]
  E --> F[06 Read hear and see evidence]
  F --> G[07 Form and check business records]
  G --> H[08 Plan and assign work]
  H --> I[09 Authorize exact action]
  I --> J[10 Execute scoped tools]
  J --> K[11 Verify reconcile and close]
  K --> L[12 Learn evaluate and release]
  L -. reviewed change .-> C
  L -. tested release .-> D
  K -. unresolved outcome .-> H
  G -. missing evidence .-> F
